{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Second chance.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You were tired of modern life, hard and empty. Until, at the end of the day, a request for change is granted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An unknown system teleports you to another world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Waking up in another world, you find yourself in another world. Now with different clothes, forests, and a skill system, you need to hunt and find out what really happened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><br>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a diverse world with forests, villages, caves, alone or with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hunt to survive, seek knowledge to create your base and your equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Eliminate bosses and predators to improve your skills and equipment.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3684830?t=1753545289","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3684830?t=1753545289","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684830/3c7e57ada4d3b35087bc79fbf61d796b5085f803/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753545289","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684830/3c7e57ada4d3b35087bc79fbf61d796b5085f803/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753545289","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Second chance.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You were tired of modern life, hard and empty. Until, at the end of the day, a request for change is granted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An unknown system teleports you to another world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Waking up in another world, you find yourself in another world. Now with different clothes, forests, and a skill system, you need to hunt and find out what really happened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><br>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a diverse world with forests, villages, caves, alone or with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hunt to survive, seek knowledge to create your base and your equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Eliminate bosses and predators to improve your skills and equipment.</p>","developers":["Yuki Game Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684830/c6ea823f1c90c14c8b4ff770791c638364160226/header.jpg?t=1753545289","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257170539,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257170539/movie480.mp4?t=1753545285","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257170539/movie_max.mp4?t=1753545285"},"name":"Game Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257170539/f09f7a1d5c0c88c46bc349ad3a1bc91b12b7166f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1753545285","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257170539/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1753545285","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257170539/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1753545285"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257149511,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257149511/movie480.mp4?t=1753545287","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257149511/movie_max.mp4?t=1753545287"},"name":"Customization","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257149511/a856fe7e7a6d521f8d6027a5bf58c49b09107779/movie_600